(7522483, 1202259, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is perhaps the only entry that takes a transcendent approach to the challenge theme, in that you are reflecting on the way in which nature works its wonders to perform.  Your subject is tiny, generally unnoticed, yet your framing is global.  And the beauty is that this works; in spite of virtually any obstacle encountered, this spreads magic every day.  The picture is technically excellent too; not just sharp and nicely in focus, but it has a lovely implied yin-yang graphic dimension that reinforces your homage to the cyclical interconnectedness of the seed with the plant. Which is the parent?  A beautiful question to ask, isn''t it?  9. Thank you.</td>', 'This is perhaps the only entry that takes a transcendent approach to the challenge theme, in that you are reflecting on the way in which nature works its wonders to perform.  Your subject is tiny, generally unnoticed, yet your framing is global.  And the beauty is that this works; in spite of virtually any obstacle encountered, this spreads magic every day.  The picture is technically excellent too; not just sharp and nicely in focus, but it has a lovely implied yin-yang graphic dimension that reinforces your homage to the cyclical interconnectedness of the seed with the plant. Which is the parent?  A beautiful question to ask, isn''t it?  9. Thank you.', '2017-07-10 06:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
