(7522810, 1202208, 124190, '<td valign="top">At first I was a bit frightened seeing very scary Viking-like female ghosts with ears....dark angels......then it struck me......my favorite animals....giraffes! Instant relief. Then I wondered if you came upon them in a night-time ride and was there seeing them in the headlights. What a surprise that must have been! Overwhelming beauty indeed!  This capture and processing poeticizes the experience perfectly.  Incredible interpretation of what must have been an extraordinary experience!</td>', 'At first I was a bit frightened seeing very scary Viking-like female ghosts with ears....dark angels......then it struck me......my favorite animals....giraffes! Instant relief. Then I wondered if you came upon them in a night-time ride and was there seeing them in the headlights. What a surprise that must have been! Overwhelming beauty indeed!  This capture and processing poeticizes the experience perfectly.  Incredible interpretation of what must have been an extraordinary experience!', '2017-07-11 10:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
