(7523421, 1202259, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oooh, oooh; I know what those are! I have a bunch in my garden right now. Next year''s Columbine :-) Good topic and I''m glad you included seedheads. I think they''re really interesting and it gave me the context to know what I was looking at.</td>', 'Oooh, oooh; I know what those are! I have a bunch in my garden right now. Next year''s Columbine :-) Good topic and I''m glad you included seedheads. I think they''re really interesting and it gave me the context to know what I was looking at.', '2017-07-14 12:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523423, 1202383, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very well captured.</td>', 'Very well captured.', '2017-07-14 12:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523426, 1202188, 65234, '<td valign="top">Certainly gorgeous in quantity, you''ve got a breathtaking background, and a this is exactly the sort of subject I expected to see in this challenge. Kind of want an even lower perspective but I realize at some point you lose the sense of just how big the field of flowers is ... so maybe not.</td>', 'Certainly gorgeous in quantity, you''ve got a breathtaking background, and a this is exactly the sort of subject I expected to see in this challenge. Kind of want an even lower perspective but I realize at some point you lose the sense of just how big the field of flowers is ... so maybe not.', '2017-07-14 12:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523427, 1202318, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great subject for this challenge; to my eye, the varying shapes and reflections keep the individuals in the group from being overwhelmed by sheer numbers.</td>', 'Great subject for this challenge; to my eye, the varying shapes and reflections keep the individuals in the group from being overwhelmed by sheer numbers.', '2017-07-14 12:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523428, 1202384, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, what fun! Delightful image and unexpected subject. I might have cropped even closer on both sides and made it a portrait orientation, but I''m just fascinated by the reflections, anyway.</td>', 'Oh, what fun! Delightful image and unexpected subject. I might have cropped even closer on both sides and made it a portrait orientation, but I''m just fascinated by the reflections, anyway.', '2017-07-14 12:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523429, 1202350, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that there''s just a few perfectly vertical sunflowers and everything else is off-kilter, including the horizon. Makes it all much more interesting to me. A rolling hillside of sunflowers.</td>', 'I like the fact that there''s just a few perfectly vertical sunflowers and everything else is off-kilter, including the horizon. Makes it all much more interesting to me. A rolling hillside of sunflowers.', '2017-07-14 12:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523430, 1201836, 65234, '<td valign="top">I would not have thought to use clouds as my subject, but it works well here. Different shapes and sizes keep it interesting. Well done!</td>', 'I would not have thought to use clouds as my subject, but it works well here. Different shapes and sizes keep it interesting. Well done!', '2017-07-14 12:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523431, 1202208, 65234, '<td valign="top">Giraffes at night? That''s what I''m seeing. And I can''t really tell how many there are, but it FEELS like a lot, so this works for me.</td>', 'Giraffes at night? That''s what I''m seeing. And I can''t really tell how many there are, but it FEELS like a lot, so this works for me.', '2017-07-14 12:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7523433, 1202374, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like masts as a subject for this challenge, but I think I''d prefer seeing JUST the masts, and maybe even some of those cropped out. Also would like a bit more tonality in the sky, if it was there. Maybe shoot from a lower angle? JMO.</td>', 'I like masts as a subject for this challenge, but I think I''d prefer seeing JUST the masts, and maybe even some of those cropped out. Also would like a bit more tonality in the sky, if it was there. Maybe shoot from a lower angle? JMO.', '2017-07-14 12:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
